## Worksheet

**F1 Core loop** — one `st`/`G` state object; `R(st)`/mulberry32-style cursor `st.rs` used everywhere (no `Math.random`); `endTurn()` calls storm→power→production→needs→morale→population→caravan→events→endcheck in fixed order. Score: 2

**F2 Map** — `W=8,NT=64` grid; `genMap()` uses seeded `R(st)`; `canBuildAt()` checks `b.ter.includes(t.tr)`; `adjMult()` multiplies output in `prodBreakdown()`. Score: 2

**F3 Economy** — soilworks(water→soil)→greenhouse(soil+water→food); mine(ore)→forge(ore+power→metal); `caps()`+`addRes()` clamp and log overflow (`stats.overflow`). Score: 2

**F4 Population** — colonist records `{skill,fatigue,morale,job,assigned}`; `skillMult()` and fatigue penalty read in `prodBreakdown()`. Score: 2

**F5 Needs** — `stepNeeds()` sets `shortNow`; `stepMorale()` applies -12 morale on shortage, +3 recovery; `moraleMult()` used in production. Score: 2

**F6 Research** — 10 nodes; `researchStatus()` enforces `req`; `payCost`; effects read via `st.done.includes()` in `resMult`, `damageBld`, `caps`, `unlockedBld`. Score: 2

**F7 Events** — 12 events; weighted `pool.reduce(w)` selection; 6 choice-events (refugees, bloom, pedlar, sickness, vault, strike); `st.evCd[id]=8` cooldown. Score: 2

**F8 Trade** — `priceOf()` reads `st.res` scarcity + `cv.drift` random-walk; `cv.inv` decremented on buy; `tradeBuy`/`tradeSell` both functional. Score: 2

**F9 Hazard** — `stormDue()` every 8 turns, `stormSeverity()` scales with turn; `damageBld` disables/degrades hp thresholds read in `prodBreakdown`; `stormwall`/`shelters` reduce damage; `repair()` costs parts+fatigue. Score: 2

**F10 Save/load** — `serialize()`→textarea; `loadState()`/`validateState()` throw on bad input, shown via `UI.saveErr`/`#saveErr`. Score: 2

**F11 End conditions** — win at turn 60 (`pop>=12 && needsMet`) and lose (`cols.length<=0`) both in `stepEndCheck()`; `scoreOf()` combines pop/research/stock/turns; modal renders summary table. Score: 2

**F12 UI** — `ui.tab()` switching; log carries `l.t` turn numbers; extensive `data-tip` formula tooltips; Space/Digit1-6 shortcuts; `@media(max-width:520px)` layout. Score: 2

**F13 Dev panel** — `runTests()` 22 substantive assertions (caps, prereqs, hash roundtrip, repair economics); `runBenchmark()`/`simulate()`/`policyTurn()` run headless 200 turns, prints `stateHash`. Score: 2

**G1** — `st.done.includes('filtration')` etc. read in `resMult()`, multiplies `out.outs` in `prodBreakdown()`, used every production step and shown in tooltips. Score: 4

**G2** — `shortNow.food/water` set in `stepNeeds()` → `-12` morale in `stepMorale()` → `moraleMult()` scales output in `prodBreakdown()`. Score: 4

**G3** — `stepStorm()`→`damageBld()` lowers hp → hp<70/<30 cuts/disables output in `prodBreakdown()` → `repair()` spends parts+fatigue, restores hp=100. Score: 4

**G4** — `priceOf()` reads `st.res[r]/cap` scarcity and `cv.drift[r]` (random-walked each turn in `stepCaravan`), feeds `buyPrice`/`sellPrice`. Score: 4

**G5** — `refugees` choices write `addColonist`/`subRes`/`bumpMorale`; `sickness` choices write colonist `.fatigue`/`.morale` directly, not just log. Score: 4

